Trykst
Collaborative Typst editor with native OIDC and seamless SSO.

Modifications Copyright 2026 Aleksandar Trkulja

This product is a modified version of TypstDrive
(https://github.com/SirBlobby/TypstDrive), Copyright 2026 SirBlobby,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Changes relative to TypstDrive include, among others:
- Authentication replaced by OpenID Connect: no local accounts or passwords,
  just-in-time provisioning, server-side sessions, RP-initiated and
  back-channel logout
- Roles, guest users and organizations derived from the identity provider
- People picker backed by the identity provider's directory; invitations
  for users who have not signed in yet
- Content restructured into projects with members, documents and per-document
  file trees; spaces, account-wide files and per-document invitations removed
- Removed: password login, registration, setup wizard, desktop sync API
- Renamed to Trykst; package namespaces @project and @trykst (@typstdrive still accepted)
- Live preview compiled in the browser with typst.ts instead of on the server

The individual changes are recorded in the version control history.

This product includes the Typst compiler (https://github.com/typst/typst),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The frontend includes typst.ts (https://github.com/Myriad-Dreamin/typst.ts),
